  "answers": [
    {
      "question": "材料中，一个系统要满足哪些条件才是线性的？请用中文解释。",
      "seconds": 10.08,
      "response": {
        "supported": true,
        "answerSegments": [
          {
            "id": "seg_1",
            "text": "一个系统要是线性的，必须同时满足可加性和齐次性；只满足其中一项还不够。",
            "citationIds": [
              "cit_46350c3bd14c4b879a4c0b74f741aa26_1",
              "cit_46350c3bd14c4b879a4c0b74f741aa26_2"
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "seg_2",
            "text": "可加性：把两个输入相加后送入系统，所得输出应等于这两个输入分别送入系统时所得输出的和。",
            "citationIds": [
              "cit_46350c3bd14c4b879a4c0b74f741aa26_3"
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "seg_3",
            "text": "齐次性：把输入乘以某个常数，所得输出也应是原来输出乘以同一个常数。",
            "citationIds": [
              "cit_46350c3bd14c4b879a4c0b74f741aa26_4"
            ]
          }
        ],
        "citations": [
          {
            "id": "cit_46350c3bd14c4b879a4c0b74f741aa26_1",
            "materialId": "mat_3f244fc615364de5a023b002eee33db6",
            "versionId": "ver_5e7a4a4be2b54c4b9319ba3af4e05b17",
            "title": "signals-systems-self-authored.pdf",
            "pageStart": 1,
            "pageEnd": 1,
            "quote": "线性系统必须同时满足可加性和齐次性。"
          },
          {
            "id": "cit_46350c3bd14c4b879a4c0b74f741aa26_2",
            "materialId": "mat_3f244fc615364de5a023b002eee33db6",
            "versionId": "ver_5e7a4a4be2b54c4b9319ba3af4e05b17",
            "title": "signals-systems-self-authored.pdf",
            "pageStart": 1,
            "pageEnd": 1,
            "quote": "两项缺一不可；仅满足其中一项，不能判定系统线性。"
          },
          {
            "id": "cit_46350c3bd14c4b879a4c0b74f741aa26_3",
            "materialId": "mat_3f244fc615364de5a023b002eee33db6",
            "versionId": "ver_5e7a4a4be2b54c4b9319ba3af4e05b17",
            "title": "signals-systems-self-authored.pdf",
            "pageStart": 1,
            "pageEnd": 1,
            "quote": "可加性：两个输入相加后产生的输出，等于两个输入分别产生的输出之和。"
          },
          {
            "id": "cit_46350c3bd14c4b879a4c0b74f741aa26_4",
            "materialId": "mat_3f244fc615364de5a023b002eee33db6",
            "versionId": "ver_5e7a4a4be2b54c4b9319ba3af4e05b17",
            "title": "signals-systems-self-authored.pdf",
            "pageStart": 1,
            "pageEnd": 1,
            "quote": "齐次性：输入乘以常数后，输出也乘以同一个常数。"
          }
        ],
