    {
      "question": "根据材料，y(t)=t*x(t) 是不是线性系统、是不是时不变系统？",
      "seconds": 10.98,
      "response": {
        "supported": true,
        "answerSegments": [
          {
            "id": "seg_1",
            "text": "y(t)=t*x(t) 是线性系统：输入相加时，t[x₁(t)+x₂(t)]=tx₁(t)+tx₂(t)，满足可加性；输入乘以常数 a 时，t[ax(t)]=a[tx(t)]，满足齐次性。",
            "citationIds": [
              "cit_5eb1b66da65d4e7c9fcdeae48d46e07d_1",
              "cit_5eb1b66da65d4e7c9fcdeae48d46e07d_2"
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "seg_2",
            "text": "它不是时不变系统：输入平移为 x(t−τ) 后，系统输出为 t·x(t−τ)；而原输出作同样平移得到 (t−τ)·x(t−τ)，两者一般不相等。线性与时不变性是不同条件，不能相互替代。",
            "citationIds": [
              "cit_5eb1b66da65d4e7c9fcdeae48d46e07d_3",
              "cit_5eb1b66da65d4e7c9fcdeae48d46e07d_2",
              "cit_5eb1b66da65d4e7c9fcdeae48d46e07d_4"
            ]
          }
        ],
        "citations": [
          {
            "id": "cit_5eb1b66da65d4e7c9fcdeae48d46e07d_1",
            "materialId": "mat_3f244fc615364de5a023b002eee33db6",
            "versionId": "ver_5e7a4a4be2b54c4b9319ba3af4e05b17",
            "title": "signals-systems-self-authored.pdf",
            "pageStart": 1,
            "pageEnd": 1,
            "quote": "线性系统必须同时满足可加性和齐次性。"
          },
          {
            "id": "cit_5eb1b66da65d4e7c9fcdeae48d46e07d_2",
            "materialId": "mat_3f244fc615364de5a023b002eee33db6",
            "versionId": "ver_5e7a4a4be2b54c4b9319ba3af4e05b17",
            "title": "signals-systems-self-authored.pdf",
            "pageStart": 2,
            "pageEnd": 2,
            "quote": "系统 y(t)=t*x(t) 是线性的，但不是时不变的。"
          },
          {
            "id": "cit_5eb1b66da65d4e7c9fcdeae48d46e07d_3",
            "materialId": "mat_3f244fc615364de5a023b002eee33db6",
            "versionId": "ver_5e7a4a4be2b54c4b9319ba3af4e05b17",
            "title": "signals-systems-self-authored.pdf",
            "pageStart": 2,
            "pageEnd": 2,
            "quote": "时不变性：输入沿时间平移，输出应当只发生同样的时间平移。"
          },
          {
            "id": "cit_5eb1b66da65d4e7c9fcdeae48d46e07d_4",
            "materialId": "mat_3f244fc615364de5a023b002eee33db6",
            "versionId": "ver_5e7a4a4be2b54c4b9319ba3af4e05b17",
            "title": "signals-systems-self-authored.pdf",
            "pageStart": 2,
            "pageEnd": 2,
            "quote": "线性讨论输入的叠加与倍乘，时不变性讨论时间平移，两者不能互相替代。"
          }
        ],
